---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import CTABanner from '../components/sections/CTABanner.astro';
import { HandCoins, Backpack, Package, ShieldAlert } from 'lucide-react';

const bring = ['Camera', 'Sunglasses', 'Sunscreen', 'Hat', 'Food', 'Drinks (beer is fine — no liquor or glass bottles)', 'A cooler to take your catch home'];
const included = ['Ice', 'Bait', 'All fishing equipment', 'All fishing licenses', 'Crew cleans your catch'];
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Trip Preparations | Fish The Wahoo Charleston"
  description="Everything you need to know before your Fish The Wahoo charter — how to find the boats, what to bring, what's included, gratuity, and our cancellation terms."
>
  <section class="pt-32 pb-8 bg-nautical-dark">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <span class="section-label">Before You Go</span>
      <h1 class="text-5xl text-white uppercase mb-6">Trip Preparations</h1>
      <div class="w-24 h-1 bg-accent-orange mb-8"></div>
      <p class="text-slate-400 text-lg">Everything you need to prepare for your upcoming Charleston fishing adventure.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-16 bg-nautical-dark">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 space-y-10">
      <div class="metallic-card rounded-xl p-8">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-6">
          <HandCoins className="w-6 h-6 text-accent-orange" />
          <h2 class="text-2xl text-white uppercase">Gratuity</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="space-y-4 text-slate-300 text-sm leading-relaxed">
          <p>The industry standard gratuity for the crew is 20%. The crew will gladly accept whatever tip you feel their efforts deserved.</p>
          <p>Our captains and mates work hard to optimize the experience of their clients, and they rely on their tips to make a living. That said, no customer should ever pay a gratuity they feel was not earned. Hand the gratuity to the captain — he'll ensure proper distribution to the mate.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="metallic-card rounded-xl p-8">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-6">
          <Backpack className="w-6 h-6 text-accent-orange" />
          <h2 class="text-2xl text-white uppercase">What To Bring</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
          {bring.map((item) => (
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3 text-slate-300 text-sm">
              <div class="w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-accent-orange rounded-full shrink-0"></div>
              {item}
            </div>
          ))}
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="metallic-card rounded-xl p-8">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-6">
          <Package className="w-6 h-6 text-accent-orange" />
          <h2 class="text-2xl text-white uppercase">Included In Your Trip</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
          {included.map((item) => (
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3 text-slate-300 text-sm">
              <div class="w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-accent-orange rounded-full shrink-0"></div>
              {item}
            </div>
          ))}
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="metallic-card rounded-xl p-8">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-6">
          <ShieldAlert className="w-6 h-6 text-accent-orange" />
          <h2 class="text-2xl text-white uppercase">Cancellation &amp; Refund Disclaimer</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="space-y-4 text-slate-300 text-sm leading-relaxed">
          <p>While Fish The Wahoo tries its best to (1) keep our vessels neat, clean, and organized, (2) accurately describe our boats, and (3) accurately describe our services and normal customer experience, we cannot warrant or guarantee in any way (1) that any particular feature or system of any boat will be in working order, (2) the overall condition of any vessel, (3) that any particular kind of fishing will be attempted — the captain will decide based on circumstances, or (4) that any particular species will be caught or targeted.</p>
          <p class="text-white font-semibold">Cancellation terms:</p>
          <ul class="space-y-2 list-disc list-inside marker:text-accent-orange">
            <li>Cancellations made <span class="text-white">more than 30 days</span> before departure receive a full refund of the deposit.</li>
            <li>Cancellations made <span class="text-white">7 to 30 days</span> before departure forfeit the deposit.</li>
            <li>Cancellations made <span class="text-white">inside 7 days</span> of departure are responsible for the full charter payment.</li>
            <li>Once the client is on the boat and the boat leaves the dock, no client is entitled to any discount or refund for any reason.</li>
          </ul>
          <p>By completing a booking, you indicate you have read and agree to these terms.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="text-center pt-4">
        <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm">
          Also check out our <a href="/faq/" class="text-accent-orange font-semibold hover:underline">Frequently Asked Questions</a>.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <CTABanner />
</BaseLayout>
